    "description": "Meescan is the easiest way to checkout items in your library. No need to carry your library card around or stand in line at the circulation desk. Simply scan your books with your phone or tablet.\r\n\r\nIf Meescan is not available at your library yet and you'd like to  test the app, just download and print our demo barcodes from https://www.meescan.com/mobile-app.html",
